load @term/seed/structure/set
  find set

# A point: the atom of geometry, a location with no extent. A space is a set of points with structure (nearness,
# distance, straightness) layered on. The twenty-four directions of the substrate are points of the 24-cell, and the
# center they surround is a point. The form carries the set the point belongs to.
form point
  link space, like set
